Vasishtha bids Bharata cease grief and perform rites --- Bharata laments over oil-preserved sleeping-like father --- Priests place king on bier amid strewn gold --- Servants build sandal agaru deodara pyre --- Priests lay king with scents and offer fire --- Chanters sing Samans as queens circumambulate wailing --- Women cry piteously like kraunca hens --- Mourners offer Sarayu water and grieve ten days
